*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&      Module  EXIT_COMMAND  INPUT
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*       text
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
MODULE EXIT_COMMAND INPUT.

  CASE GV_OKCODE.
    WHEN 'CANC' OR 'BACK'.
      LEAVE TO SCREEN 0.
    WHEN 'EXIT'.
      LEAVE PROGRAM.
  ENDCASE.

ENDMODULE.

